  contactDamage: 1
  description: A tall crimson hood with a white slit where questions come out. Its
    brands do not ask where you are. They ask where you will be.
  tactics: Telegraphs, then fires TWIN red homing brands in quick succession. The
    first pulls your dodge; the second punishes it. Break line by moving hard perpendicular
    through both, or kill it during the telegraph. High value target - never let
    two Inquisitors sync.
